{
  "passageNumber": 36,
  "title": "Future Life",
  "units": [
    "第一单元 开始",
    "第二单元 发展",
    "第三单元 结尾"
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "assets/images/00.png",
      "en": "Future Life",
      "cn": "第 36 篇",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/01.png",
      "en": "What do you think of future life?",
      "cn": "你认为未来生活会怎样？",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/02.png",
      "en": "Do you wonder how the world might change?",
      "cn": "你想知道世界可能会如何改变吗？",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/03.png",
      "en": "Here are some ideas.",
      "cn": "这里有一些想法。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "en": "Which of these might come true?",
      "cn": "其中哪些可能会实现呢？",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/05.png",
      "en": "In the future, the weather will become warmer and warmer.",
      "cn": "未来，天气会变得越来越暖和。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "en": "The sea level will rise as well.",
      "cn": "海平面也会上升。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/07.png",
      "en": "However, weather changes won't mean changing clothes.",
      "cn": "然而，天气变化并不意味着要换衣服。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/08.png",
      "en": "A new kind of coat can keep us warm when it's cold, and cool when it's hot.",
      "cn": "一种新型外套能在寒冷时让我们保暖，在炎热时让我们凉爽。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "en": "We won't travel by bus or car any more.",
      "cn": "我们将不再乘公共汽车或汽车旅行。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/10.png",
      "en": "Every family can afford a small plane.",
      "cn": "每个家庭都买得起一架小飞机。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/11.png",
      "en": "It'll be cheap to travel anywhere--not only over land, but also over the sea or even into space.",
      "cn": "去任何地方旅行都会很便宜，不仅能飞越陆地，也能飞越海洋，甚至进入太空。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/12.png",
      "en": "Maybe there'll be too many planes at airports.",
      "cn": "也许机场会有太多飞机。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/13.png",
      "en": "Do you like long holidays?",
      "cn": "你喜欢长假吗？",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/14.png",
      "en": "If so, you will enjoy the future life.",
      "cn": "如果喜欢，你会享受未来生活。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/15.png",
      "en": "Turn on your machines and robots, and they will do all the heavy and difficult jobs for you.",
      "cn": "打开你的机器和机器人，它们会为你做所有又重又难的工作。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/16.png",
      "en": "With their help, people will have shorter working hours and longer holidays.",
      "cn": "在它们的帮助下，人们会有更短的工作时间和更长的假期。",
      "unit": 3
    }
  ],
